  "quest.23C1566E5ACD3D87.title": "First Basic Factory",
  "quest.23C1566E5ACD3D87.quest_subtitle": "Drain and empty the Enrichment Chamber before upgrading it. The Basic Tier Installer and empty predecessor are consumed in the 5x5 Mechanical Crafting recipe; right-click installer upgrades are disabled for managed Factory and Energy Cube families.",
